<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="5">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Label="Scene 1" Type="New Act">
      <Text>Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Abyssal Habitat</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="10 3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ADRIENNE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOSES">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUY &amp; ADRIENNE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">1. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life Before</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The habitat is deep in an unknown abyss. The deep-sea community lives beyond the transparent back wall of it. There is a miniature scale of the habitat stationed within the space.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienne</Text>
      <Text> idly sits while </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Thuy</Text>
      <Text> stares at the puppet </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text> swimming outside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Life before was...
life before was well made.
Life before was...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Life before, we were made of gills
and scales-
I’d kill to have a tail!
</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="8" Style="AllCaps">
</Text>      <Text>We are twenty thousands stories
under the sea, napping on sea beds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>And now we’re left without bread...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ThuY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>It’s time we watched our carbs, and watch the carps!
</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="8" Style="AllCaps">
</Text>      <Text>Water, Tsunamis, continental shifts-
It is all thanks to twenty twelve.
But here, we survived the end of the world!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="8" Style="AllCaps">
</Text>      <Text>Fishes, octopus, sea anemone!
It is all thanks to twenty twelve.
A tale: we warned all the end of the world!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Dead-inside humans tell no tales.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Indeed. There are no tales left on land.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>2012 has taken so much away from us!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(Intimately)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But not us...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>This habitat... Home. What I’ve funded. You trust-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It’s the most fun I’ve had!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You mean the most insanity you’ve had.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Baby Giant Squids</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Am I insane? Ink if “yes.” Don’t if “no.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text> do not ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>See?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes... The sea is everything to you...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The sea is everything to the world. To life. The beginning, middle, and end.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>2012 is the end of our lives. 2013 is the end of our world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>2023 meters is how far down this habitat is stationed. I can spout number, too!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Thuy</Text>
      <Text> lovingly swipes at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienne</Text>
      <Text> with peace-signed fingers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Get out of my zone!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It takes a thousand meters higher or deeper to get out of the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">bathypelagic zone</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I get it... I should have invested in the construction of a habitat at the photic zone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yup. You were so adamant that yachts would come across our home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Peasants.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now look at us. We’re rich in life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text> play around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Unpleasant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You are being such a Squidward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m Mr. Krabs when he gave away his </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Krabby</Text>
      <Text> Patties as free samples to compete with Plankton.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That was the last thing we saw.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh yes, I invested in Netflix.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It would’ve been cool if they lasted a few years and started putting out original shows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The cards were not in the world’s favor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But that’s okay, cause you are my tv now!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>If I had the chance to reinvest in Netflix, I’d pitch a gameshow where you face hoards of squids.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who would win? Y’all or me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text> ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’d ink too if I could! Alright, fight me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh Thuy. What will I do with you...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Squids, give me your death blow!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Moses</Text>
      <Text> enters, holding a miniature submarine. They ramp the submarine into the miniature habitat. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text> scurry off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Am I in the afterlife?</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life Before</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’ll take you there! What the Hell, bud?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hold up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re always held up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">You hold up</Text>
      <Text>. What are you two doing down in the abyss?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Surviving. You?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Personally, thriving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Where did you come from?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Reno.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Even the tsunamis got Reno.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Tsunamis?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Quit flooding us with questions.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Give us some answers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Why don’t you check it out for yourself? Come up to the shores.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No way?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No way out. We’re stuck here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Nowhere. There’s nowhere to go anyways.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There’s Time Square.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Isn’t that underwater by now?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes, schools of fishes called “tourists.” No, we’re not underwater.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Time Square should be.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Is everyone still alive?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Alive as you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>So dead inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well, get this through your empty heads: the world did not end!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>December 21 is a myth. There are no worldwide tsunamis.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But the world went crazy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re the one who’ve gone crazy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who invested in my crazy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">Crazys</Text>
      <Text> help </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">crazys</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Look, let’s deal with this </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea</Text>
      <Text> situation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That explorer is twenty thousand meters out of your league.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to Moses)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’re the first person we’ve had contact with!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’ve made many friends.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Giant squids are not your friends.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Giant squids...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m the giant squid and Adrienne is the baby squid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Thuy is the baby squid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh so it’s an allegory for your relationship.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Gory with blood boiling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The giant squid keeps giving us fish carcass like a kitten.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Like a cat in the tree, are you stuck in this deep ravine?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Adrienne</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>Yes.</Text>
          <Text></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Thuy</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
          <Text>No!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">...</Text>
      <Text> Adrienne[Angel Investor Surname]?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They live up to the aquatic name.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You fund the contractors that build submarine parts that I assemble and use. Cheap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But not efficient.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I funded this underwater habitat since 2009, with some sketchy former naval personnel who constructed the past SEALABs. I ran out of money by the time we got around to the escape pod.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The baby giant squids toyed around with it. They thought it was another giant squid with its single window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That escape pod you’re talking about may be the one found in the Pacific giant trash patch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Great Pacific Garbage Patch? </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The world may not be over, but it is still trash.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Will you look at that. There is nothing of value to return to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Wait. I can take you up. You have got to try the goldfish mac and cheese.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Goldfishes are abominations... but with mac and cheese, it’s an atrocity!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m done with canned mac and cheese. I miss being in the wheatfields with cows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We will not kowtow to you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I will, the second we reach land.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That’s the spirit! All you need to do is take me to your giant squid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You ghoul!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to Thuy)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’re fools!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You were misled to the depths of Hell. I’m here to lead you back to the heavens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Angel investor or not, there’s no money in the new life you’d have.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There is indeed money in new life: that giant squid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Don’t lay a single turbine on my squid!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The real monster here is Thuy. You do not want to mess with them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m here to capture... memories.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>My Japanese colleagues captured the first footages of a giant squid in mid 2012. They have yet to release it into the public.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The news just did. That’s why I’m here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Thuy</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’ll cut their time short if we agree for them to cut our time here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I love our time here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(Intimately and pathetically)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You’d love our time in the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I guess you two are busy. I’ll swing by-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Stay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text> return.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh sure, you’ll listen when they say “stay.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You must be playing games. You can talk to squids?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>These babies can answer that. Ink if “yes.” Don’t if “no.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text> reluctantly ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’d love to connect you with my friends at the aquarium.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The aquarium...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes, where we’ve had our dates- </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">meetings</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I see...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>My little bottlenose... When I get back my money, I could invest in our own aquarium.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Would you invest time in us?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’d invest the rest of eternity.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’m eternally grateful for your compromising but not how you’re doing it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy &amp; Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">Compromising</Text>
      <Text>... What a nerd.</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps"></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Moses</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yeah, uh aquariums have good lighting and well-fed animals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well water me stupid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Can you get your mother here? This nice human would like a word with her. Take good care of Moses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">baby giant squids</Text>
      <Text> swim off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 2</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Giant Squid</Text>
      <Text> emerges.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The submarine shoots a net towards the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Giant Squid</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Giant Squid</Text>
      <Text> deflects the net. The giant squid pulls the Moses and their submarine into the twilight zone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who needs an aquarium when we have the best one in the world here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Moses could have surfaced us, so we could tell the world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That sea-monger tried to net our giant squid friend. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>They are not our friend! You can make all sorts of friend, if we have internet again!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The net has no worth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Neither is my net worth! What have you done?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The real question is “what is done?” The world is.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Life before, we were made of lungs and skin. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now we’re back where we belong.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Life before will return again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Go marvel at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Italic">this</Text>
      <Text> world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienne</Text>
      <Text> faceplants on the glass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Here’s to... depths and death-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Here’s to life after.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Thuy</Text>
      <Text> walks off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 3</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>This is all just a dream...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>A </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">sleeper shark</Text>
      <Text> emerges and rams into the glass that </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienne</Text>
      <Text> is touching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienne</Text>
      <Text> is taken aback.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I know your kind. You’re the mascot for a loan investment company I worked for.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">sleeper shark</Text>
      <Text> paces.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>A sleeper shark. I loved that commercial where you eat your competition, the squid mascot-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">sleeper shark</Text>
      <Text> pays attention.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Are you looking for the giant?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienne</Text>
      <Text> points out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Time to get my hands dirty. Get their tentacles dirty!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Sleeper Shark</Text>
      <Text> swims off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There shall be no life after.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Blackout.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act">
      <Text>Fin</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

  <Watermarking Opacity="70" Position="Diagonal Descending">
